message.content:
Below is a minimal, self‑contained example that shows how to create a “flip‑card” that rotates when you hover over it.  
Copy the code into an `.html` file (or paste it into your existing page) and open it in a browser.

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Obracająca się karta</title>
<style>
  /* Wrapper – keeps perspective */
  .card-wrapper {
    width: 300px;
    height: 200px;
    perspective: 1000px;          /* gives depth */
    margin: 50px auto;            /* center horizontally */
  }

  /* Card itself – contains front & back */
  .card {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    position: relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;   /* enables 3D children */
    transition: transform 0.6s ease; /* smooth rotation */
  }

  /* Flip on hover */
  .card-wrapper:hover .card {
    transform: rotateY(180deg);     /* rotate around Y axis */
  }

  /* Front & Back faces */
  .card-face {
    position: absolute;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    backface-visibility: hidden;   /* hide backside when turned away */
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2);
  }

  .card-front {
    background: #fff;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: #333;
  }

  .card-back {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    transform: rotateY(180deg);      /* start rotated so it's hidden initially */
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card-wrapper">
  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-face card-front">
      Front side
    </div>
    <div class="card-face card-back">
      Back side
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
```

### How it works
* `perspective` on the wrapper creates a 3‑D space.
* `transform-style: preserve-3d` on the card allows its child elements to keep their 3‑D positions.
* `backface-visibility: hidden` hides each face when it’s turned away from the viewer.
* Hovering over the wrapper triggers a `rotateY(180deg)` on the card, flipping it around the vertical axis.

Feel free to replace the text or add images inside `.card-front` and `.card-back` to suit your design.
